    "explanation": "Greymane's outstanding single-target DPS makes him particularly potent on Maps where there are multiple Mercenary Camps to be captured. Beyond this point, Greymane's relative well-roundedness does not make him particularly effective or weak anywhere, although his lack of self sustain might make him unsuited to offlane against some of the better duelists."
