    {
      "name": "Attack Build",
      "label": "Recommended",
      "description": "Greymane's Basic Attack Build revolves around improving his Basic Attacks and thus sustained damage output. Although it provides less waveclear and burst damage than its counterpart, it provides Greymane with more consistent sustain damage.\n\nLord of His Pack greatly increases Greymane's damage, and should be the pick in most games where you have any kind of crowd control. If you do not have many Abilities to trigger Lord of His Pack in your team, Alpha Killer is a great option for more power in teamfights, while Eager Wolf is better in the PvE.",
